Hee-hee!
I've been waiting for you.{VAR BE01}
Did you enjoy flying with the help of
the Mistralton Gym cannons?{VAR BE01}
They're my pride and joy!{VAR BE01}
This time, let's try something else!{VAR BE01}

You're an amazing Pokémon Trainer.{VAR BE01}
My Pokémon and I are happy,
because for the first time in a while,{VAR BE00}
we could fight with our full strength.{VAR BE01}
This is an official League Gym Badge.
I think it will look good on you.{VAR BE01}

Wow, hot stuff!{VAR BE01}
With that many Gym Badges,
Pokémon up to Lv. 70 will obey you.{VAR BE01}
Also, as thanks for a Pokémon battle
that made me very happy,{VAR BE00}
I want you to have this TM.{VAR BE01}

My present to you is Acrobatics.
If the user doesn't have a held item,{VAR BE00}
its power doubles.{VAR BE00}
It's a pretty technical move.{VAR BE01}
Be sure to compensate for the
lack of a held item!{VAR BE01}
By the way, when I flew over
Twist Mountain on the way{VAR BE00}
to Icirrus City...{VAR BE01}
Team Plasma--is that the name?
Anyway, they were heading for the city.{VAR BE01}
What kind of people are they?

Icirrus City, where you'll find the next
Gym, is past Route 7, just after you{VAR BE00}
cross Twist Mountain.{VAR BE01}
It's a hop, skip, and a jump when flying,
but it's a really challenging walk.{VAR BE01}
Heads up! Make sure you're ready for it!

Skyla: Are you and your Pokémon well?
Our battle together was so much fun.{VAR BE01}
Now, my Pokémon and I have started
training again.{VAR BE01}
I don't usually let people travel in my
cargo plane, but battling with you was{VAR BE00}
such a blast that I'd make an exception.

Just between you and me...{VAR BE01}
Rock, Electric, Ice... Flying types have
more weaknesses than people know about.{VAR BE01}
If you use Pokémon and moves of those
types, victory is practically yours!{VAR BE01}
By the way, to proceed in this Gym,
you climb in the cannons to move forward.{VAR BE01}
The cannons go up, down, left, and right.
You can get in them from anywhere!

Woo! Not many people look that good
being shot out of a cannon...{VAR BE00}
You make it look easy!{VAR BE01}
And congratulations on your victory
against the Gym Leader.

